  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Row 0 needs one marker for every row.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3140,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 94,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "That is m cells.",
      "start_ms": 3660,
      "end_ms": 4880,
      "start_frame": 110,
      "end_frame": 146,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Call 0 needs one marker for every column.",
      "start_ms": 5200,
      "end_ms": 8100,
      "start_frame": 156,
      "end_frame": 243,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "That is n cells.",
      "start_ms": 8640,
      "end_ms": 9760,
      "start_frame": 259,
      "end_frame": 293,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "But our matrix already has something interesting.",
      "start_ms": 10460,
      "end_ms": 13040,
      "start_frame": 314,
      "end_frame": 391,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The first column already has one cell for every row.",
      "start_ms": 13500,
      "end_ms": 16840,
      "start_frame": 405,
      "end_frame": 505,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "And the first row already has one cell for every column.",
      "start_ms": 17320,
      "end_ms": 21600,
      "start_frame": 520,
      "end_frame": 648,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "So instead of creating two new arrays, what if we reuse those cells?",
      "start_ms": 21980,
      "end_ms": 26220,
      "start_frame": 659,
      "end_frame": 787,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "The first column can store row markers.",
      "start_ms": 26220,
      "end_ms": 28580,
      "start_frame": 787,
      "end_frame": 857,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "And the first row can store column markers.",
      "start_ms": 29040,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "start_frame": 871,
      "end_frame": 931,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "For an interior 0, at row R, column C, we can write 0 at matrix 0 to mark the row, and matrix 0, C, to mark the column.",
      "start_ms": 31760,
      "end_ms": 44320,
      "start_frame": 953,
      "end_frame": 1330,
      "word_count": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "That removes the external marker arrays.",
      "start_ms": 44980,
      "end_ms": 47180,
      "start_frame": 1349,
      "end_frame": 1415,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "But there is one problem.",
      "start_ms": 47780,
      "end_ms": 49060,
      "start_frame": 1433,
      "end_frame": 1472,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The first row and first column are still real data.",
      "start_ms": 49340,
      "end_ms": 52440,
      "start_frame": 1480,
      "end_frame": 1573,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "If we start using them as memory, we may destroy information about whether they originally contained a 0.",
      "start_ms": 52810,
      "end_ms": 60440,
      "start_frame": 1584,
      "end_frame": 1813,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "And the corner cell, matrix 0, 0, belongs to both boundaries.",
      "start_ms": 60980,
      "end_ms": 67040,
      "start_frame": 1829,
      "end_frame": 2011,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Once we reuse that boundary storage, one cell cannot independently preserve both original boundary facts.",
      "start_ms": 67680,
      "end_ms": 75720,
      "start_frame": 2030,
      "end_frame": 2272,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "So before we reuse the boundaries, we save those two facts separately.",
      "start_ms": 76320,
      "end_ms": 81160,
      "start_frame": 2290,
      "end_frame": 2435,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Did the original first row contain a 0?",
      "start_ms": 81160,
      "end_ms": 84360,
      "start_frame": 2435,
      "end_frame": 2531,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Store that in first row 0.",
      "start_ms": 85100,
      "end_ms": 87120,
      "start_frame": 2553,
      "end_frame": 2614,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Did the original first column contain a 0?",
      "start_ms": 87700,
      "end_ms": 91080,
      "start_frame": 2631,
      "end_frame": 2732,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Store that in first call 0.",
      "start_ms": 92080,
      "end_ms": 94460,
      "start_frame": 2762,
      "end_frame": 2834,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the boundary history is safe.",
      "start_ms": 94940,
      "end_ms": 97080,
      "start_frame": 2848,
      "end_frame": 2912,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "And the matrix can become its own marker memory.",
      "start_ms": 98000,
      "end_ms": 101220,
      "start_frame": 2940,
      "end_frame": 3037,
      "word_count": 9
    }
  ],
